+
+## Creating a JSON Patch
+
+`createPatch(from, to)` produces an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902) that
+transforms `from` into `to`. It recursively emits only changed object members and array elements, and
+does not mutate either version.
+
+```ts
+import { createPatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+const patch = createPatch(
+  { user: { name: "Ada", role: "reader" } },
+  { user: { name: "Ada", role: "admin" } },
+);
+// [{ op: "replace", path: "/user/role", value: "admin" }]
+```
